WEBVTT

00:00:00.718 --> 00:00:02.718
Step 1: Restore the saved logged-in browser session

00:00:02.395 --> 00:00:05.044
Step 2: Click the New reminder button to start creating a reminder

00:00:05.044 --> 00:00:09.097
Step 3: Type a title for the new reminder and submit it

00:00:09.097 --> 00:00:26.009
Step 4: Mark the 'Book a haircut' reminder complete by clicking its checkbox

00:00:26.009 --> 00:00:28.009
Step 5: Type a search query for the haircut reminder into the Search reminders box

00:00:27.528 --> 00:00:29.528
Step 6: Clear the search box to restore the full list

00:00:28.145 --> 00:00:30.145
Step 7: Switch to the Scheduled smart list in the sidebar

00:00:30.097 --> 00:00:32.097
Step 8: Switch to the All Reminders smart list in the sidebar

00:00:32.068 --> 00:00:34.698
Step 9: Click the Completed smart list in the sidebar to view completed reminders

00:00:34.698 --> 00:00:36.698
Step 10: Switch to the Work user list in the sidebar

00:00:36.616 --> 00:00:38.734
Step 11: Return to the Today smart list
